WEBVTT

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:07.500
-[gasps]
-Ah!

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:08.416
[yells]

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:10.458
[elephant trumpeting]

00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:13.708
[Nick] Whoa!

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:19.125
[muffled shout]

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:22.000
Judy. Judy!

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.250
[pig squeals]

00:00:27.291 --> 00:00:28.500
[gasps] I knew it!

00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:33.208
[Milton whimpering]

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.958
-[snake panting]
-[Milton groaning]

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:47.875
Stop!

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:49.375
-[snake whimpers]
-[Judy grunts]

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:51.791
Please.
You don't have to hurt him.

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:53.041
[snake breathes shakily]

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.125
Hurt him?

00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:59.041
Snakes never hurt anyone.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.000
We aren't the bad guys.

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.000
They are.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.833
And this journal holds
the secret that will prove it.

00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:13.541
I have to prove it. Please.

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:18.875
This is our only chance
to set things right.

00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:21.166
And when I do,

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:25.625
my family will finally
be able to come home.

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:26.958
-[frying pan clangs]
-[Nick] Woo!

00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:29.291
-Oh, no!
-[laughs] I am here.

00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:31.208
Hopps and Wilde... [chuckles]
...dream team.

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.750
We got him. Or her.

00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:35.750
Reptiles, it's, like,
who knows? [chuckles]

00:01:37.458 --> 00:01:38.958
The cops are right behind us.

00:01:40.291 --> 00:01:41.750
Kill the snake.

00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:43.250
We'll burn the journal.

00:01:43.333 --> 00:01:45.708
If he wants it,
it's dangerous.

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:51.291
And then you two will file
a report that he attacked us,

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:55.000
and you will keep
your mouths shut.

00:01:57.625 --> 00:01:58.458
Step aside.

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:04.083
Put out the fire!

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.208
-Carrots, come on.
-Help me save him.

00:02:07.291 --> 00:02:08.625
-Carrots, we need--
-Nick.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.125
Cold! Cold!

00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:12.333
-[Kitty yells]
-[Milton groans]

00:02:13.791 --> 00:02:14.708
[snake wails]

00:02:14.791 --> 00:02:16.041
[grunts, groans]

00:02:18.291 --> 00:02:19.333
-[grunts]
-Chief.

00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:21.125
He'll be okay.

00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:23.333
Antivenom. He can be saved
with antivenom.

00:02:23.416 --> 00:02:25.875
Hopps, what did you do?

00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:27.625
-No, Hogg-- Hoggbottom.
-They're helping the snake.

00:02:27.708 --> 00:02:28.708
They're trying to kill
the chief!

00:02:28.791 --> 00:02:30.541
-Hoggbottom, no. Please.
-Backup! I need backup!

00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:32.208
-My page. Let's go.
-Wait, wait, wait.

00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:34.583
I need the journal
and probably a sweater.

00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:35.750
[shrieks]

00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:37.375
W-whoa.

00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:39.416
[gasps] Cold.

00:02:42.916 --> 00:02:44.333
-[Hoggbottom] On the ground.
-Wait.

00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:47.708
-[Hoggbottom] Oi!
-Next time, we stay home?

00:02:47.791 --> 00:02:49.125
[Hoggbottom] Don't you move.

00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:51.250
[panting, grunting]

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.291
No. Stop them!

00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:55.375
-Oi!
-[Judy] Come on.

00:02:55.458 --> 00:02:56.833
-Stop!
-Come on!

00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:58.250
Stop!

00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:00.000
[Judy grunts]

00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:01.583
[yelps]

00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:04.833
[Judy on carrot pen]
I really am just a dumb bunny.

00:03:04.916 --> 00:03:07.041
Accident.
Your words, not mine.

00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:08.750
[both shriek]

00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:15.958
[Mr. Big grunts]

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.500
Put 'em in the trunk.

00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:19.458
[both yelp]

00:03:20.041 --> 00:03:21.208
[both groan]

00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:32.375
[Purrrnacleo]
"Ter-roar" in Tundratown.

00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:34.250
[Nutriamo]
A fanging at the fiesta.

00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:36.416
A howl-a at the gala

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.708
as a venomous snake
attacks the founding family.

00:03:38.791 --> 00:03:40.708
[Howlett]
More shocking,
the snake was aided

00:03:40.791 --> 00:03:44.208
by embattled ZPD officers
Nicholas Wilde and Judy Hopps.

00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:46.750
All three now suspects
in the tragic fanging

00:03:46.833 --> 00:03:48.458
of Zootropolis's chief of police

00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:49.625
and considered
extremely dangerous.

00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:51.166
FUGITIVES ON THE LOOSE

00:03:52.083 --> 00:03:53.458
Chief Bogo...

00:03:54.583 --> 00:03:55.416
is dead.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.833
[crowd gasps]

00:03:57.458 --> 00:03:59.500
Those are words I'm glad
I don't have to say.

00:03:59.583 --> 00:04:00.458
[crowd exhales deeply]

00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:01.541
I might have to soon.

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:03.625
The doctors
are a little weirded out, but

00:04:03.708 --> 00:04:08.333
what has happened tonight
was more than horseplay.

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:12.916
[Milton] Hmm.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.791
Uh, we, uh...

00:04:14.875 --> 00:04:17.208
We're gonna take
that snake down.

00:04:17.291 --> 00:04:20.250
And the fox and that rabbit!

00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:24.791
Do you know how many mayors
they've already destroyed?

00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:31.375
One, two... I got up to two.

00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:33.625
Would you like to be "three"?

00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:37.041
I want them gone.

00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:41.125
But aren't there... laws?

00:04:41.958 --> 00:04:45.958
I will say this once, Brian.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:51.458
You will retrieve the journal
and bury them.

00:04:52.541 --> 00:04:53.375
Or maybe

00:04:53.458 --> 00:04:56.083
-I chose the wrong mayor.
-[Winddancer gulps]

00:04:58.041 --> 00:05:00.875
Did I choose the wrong mayor?

00:05:01.541 --> 00:05:02.583
[gulps]

00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:08.041
[sirens wailing]

00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:21.291
-[phone ringing]
-[Judy straining]

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.458
Hmm.

00:05:33.291 --> 00:05:34.791
[phone chimes]

00:05:35.416 --> 00:05:38.208
We saw the news

00:05:38.291 --> 00:05:40.333
Whoops I meant...

00:05:40.416 --> 00:05:43.291
Heavens I meant...

00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:44.500
This is Dad.

00:05:44.583 --> 00:05:46.208
[sighs]

00:05:46.791 --> 00:05:48.375
Mom taking over...

00:05:48.458 --> 00:05:49.791
We're worried about you.

00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:51.708
Hey.

00:05:51.791 --> 00:05:54.500
The phone is the first thing
they'll track.

00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:55.416
[Judy gasps]

00:05:55.500 --> 00:06:01.416
Sorry. I have never been on
the run from the law before.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.750
Yeah. Boy.

00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:05.791
It's almost like we shouldn't
have gone to that gala, huh?

00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:08.291
Okie doke.
We already did it your way.

00:06:08.375 --> 00:06:10.625
With Mr. Big, we do it mine.

00:06:10.708 --> 00:06:13.291
This is where having
a partner from the underworld

00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:14.708
is really gonna pay off.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.000
Raymond! And is that Kev...

00:06:22.625 --> 00:06:25.083
[♪ jazz music playing]

